report_body = "Octavio's son. Arrived at the premises in the late afternoon and proceeded directly to the wine cellar stated he was there to celebrate the closing of a deal with his father.

Exterior camera footage captured his arrival while he was speaking on the phone. 

The following statement was identified: \"I'm going to sort this out soon, I hope I don't regret it!\".

Peter has no history of food allergies."
